.idea
.DS_Store
/target
Cargo.lock
frontend/.idea
frontend/target
interpreter/.idea
interpreter/target
interpreter/proptest-regressions

# Incremental compilation cache (ModuleInterface + Full AST). Per-user
# build artifact; safe to delete at any time.
.toycache/

# Claude Code per-session state (scheduled tasks lock, local settings)
# is per-user and not tracked. The shared project settings and skills
# are (CLAUDE_CODE_INTEGRATION.md: the permissions, the toylang skill,
# the `toy hook`).
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/

# Symlink to CLAUDE.md for cross-AI-tool compatibility (Codex / Copilot
# read AGENTS.md, Claude Code reads CLAUDE.md). Convention is per-user
# preference — leave the symlink optional rather than tracking it.
AGENTS.md

# Proof-of-concept programs written *in* toylang live under `poc/`.
# Their sources and design notes are tracked -- they are the closest
# thing this repository has to a user of the language, and what they
# had to work around is how the gaps get found.
#
# Two directories under them are not: the log corpus a proof of
# concept reads (real logs, ~137 MB, nothing to do with the compiler)
# and `toy build`'s output (the executable and its link cache).
/poc/logsearch/log/
/poc/logsearch/build/
